  "characterDescription": "A minimal, overlay-style navigation that dissolves into the content — using large invisible hit-target padding, a subtle translateX label shift on hover, and animated logo swap between dark and light variants to serve immersive, full-bleed experiences where the nav must feel weightless rather than structural."
